# Spec-Kit state is tracked here on purpose. `specs/` and `.specify/feature.json`
# are this project's source of truth, so unlike the ai-tools repo this toolkit
# was copied from (which ships the engine without any one project's state),
# neither is ignored.

# Machine-local Claude Code settings (permissions/paths, never shared).
# Personal overrides like defaultMode belong here, not in settings.json.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Env files (never commit secrets)
.env*
!.env.example

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.pem

# Stack-specific ignores (node_modules, build output, test artifacts) get added
# once the stack is chosen -- see docs/design/architecture.md.
